# The menus, the keyboard and the mouse on a desktop (1280 x 800): Settings (a toggle, the theme), How
# to Play, Profile, Score Chase, the mode select and the Challenge setup, then the first Practice deal
# played by the keyboard pile focus (arrows, Enter: the 3 of Diamonds onto the 4 of Spades), undone
# (U), the same move again by a mouse drag, a hint (H), pause (Escape), restart, and leave to the title.
# viewport 1280x800@1
until 600 Patience
frames 10
click =Settings
until 120 Interface
frames 10
click =Left-handed controls
frames 10
click =Dawn Glasshouse
frames 10
click =Verdant Canopy
frames 10
save menus-settings
click =Done
frames 10
click =How to Play
until 120 Alternating runs
frames 10
click =Done
frames 10
click =Profile
until 120 Career
frames 10
