until 120 No results yet
frames 10
click =Done
frames 10
click =Play
until 120 Choose your table
frames 10
click =Challenge
until 120 constrained goals
frames 10
click One Pass
frames 10
save menus-challenge
click =← Back
until 120 Choose your table
frames 10
click =Practice
